<title>GEORGIA: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP WINNERS' CUP PRELIMINARY ROUND RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP WINNERS' CUP PRELIMINARY ROUND RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BATUMI, Georgia 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a European Cup</p>
<p>Winners' Cup preliminary round first leg match played on Friday:</p>
<p>Dynamo Batumi (Georgia) 4 Ararat Yerevan (Armenia) 2</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Dynamo Batumi - Dzhumber Chukhua 24, 32, Avtondil Glontia</p>
<p>77, Gela Shekeladze 88.</p>
<p>Ararat Yerevan - Akop Ter-Petrosyan 59, Rafael Nazaryan 82.</p>
<p>    HT:2-0.    Att: 8,000.</p>
</text>
